#: source/refs/license.rst:4
msgid "License"
msgstr "许可证"

#: source/refs/license.rst:6
msgid ""
"Most Isaac Lab packages are open-sourced under the `BSD-3-Clause license "
"<https://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-3-Clause>`_. The ``isaaclab_mimic`` "
"package and its related scripts are licensed under `Apache-2.0 "
"<https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0>`_; see ``LICENSE-mimic`` in "
"the repository. Individual files identify their license with an SPDX header."
msgstr ""
"大多数 Isaac Lab 包以 `BSD-3-Clause 许可证 "
"<https://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-3-Clause>`_ 开源。 ``isaaclab_mimic`` "
"包及其相关脚本采用 `Apache-2.0 <https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0>`_ "
"许可证，详见仓库中的 ``LICENSE-mimic`` 。各文件通过 SPDX 文件头标明许可证。"

#: source/refs/license.rst:12
msgid ""
"NVIDIA Isaac Sim is also licensed under Apache-2.0. See the bundled `Isaac "
"Sim license <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/blob/main/docs/licenses/dependencies/isaacsim-license.txt>`_ "
"and the `Isaac Sim dependency and asset licenses "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/common/licenses.html>`_. "
"Third-party dependency license texts are collected under "
"``docs/licenses/dependencies``."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA Isaac Sim 也采用 Apache-2.0 许可证。请参阅附带的 `Isaac Sim 许可证 "
"<https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/blob/main/docs/licenses/dependencies/isaacsim-license.txt>`_ 及 "
"`Isaac Sim 依赖项与资产许可证 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/common/licenses.html>`_ "
"。第三方依赖项的许可证文本集中存放在 ``docs/licenses/dependencies`` 下。"
